### create furniture item
POST http://localhost:8080/api/furniture-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "White Drawer",
  "category": "Storage",
  "style": "Minimal",
  "price": 120
}

### get furniture item
GET http://localhost:8080/api/furniture-items/{{id}}

### Create User
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "inha2@test.com",
  "displayName": "Inha",
  "authProvider": "LOCAL"
}

### List Users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get User by id (위에서 나온 id로 바꿔)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/{{userId}}